'''Caroline''' is an unlockable character that can be purchased from the Store. He also gave it to players who supported Garena Free Fire's Facebook, and those who did and already had Caroline, were awarded 499 diamonds.

=== Description ===
Caroline is a girl who grew up in a very wealthy family. She is always accompanied by bodyguards wherever she goes.

She has enough fans to fill a stadium. Undoubtedly the most popular girl in school.

Her father and her friends are what she treasures most in life.

=== Special survival ability ===
'''Extremely agile'''

''"Improves speed when loading a shotgun"''

